<title>USA: Brazil's Brahma ADRs begin trade on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Brahma ADRs begin trade on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) of Brazilian brewery Brahma began trading Wednesday, opening at 14-1/2.</p>
<p>The ADRs reached a high of 14-5/8 on total volume of 556,700 shares as of 1400 EDT/1800 GMT.</p>
<p>Companhia Cervejaria Brahma SA's ADRs are traded on the NYSE under the symbol &quot;BRH.&quot;</p>
